{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1059952/block/singleImage/3246707/df/147ad350-d140-11ee-bb3b-be13ff91dfde.png?updatedAt=1792737656\"/><figcaption>28歲名媛蔡天鳳2023年2月疑遭殺害後碎屍肢解</figcaption></figure><p>28歲名媛蔡天鳳2023年2月疑遭殺害後碎屍肢解，蔡天鳳前夫鄺港智、前家翁鄺球、前夫兄長鄺港傑被控謀殺及阻止合法埋葬屍體罪。案件今日（23日）踏入第22日審訊，惟是日須在陪審團避席下處理法律爭議，傳媒不可報道陪審團避席時的聆訊內容。 案件下周一(26日)早上續審，料繼續傳召昨天作供的控方專家證人兼政府化驗所高級化驗師譚卓寧。 案件編號：HCCC198/2025</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:43:58.698527+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:40:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T19:50:58.841892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T07:38:14.577377+00:00","content_hash":"341bd040a874b0e4d90a4f3eac83a5fc4eacbe878973604213c8707c7c1ce935","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:43:58.698527+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}